# Local documentation; existing tracked operational docs remain versioned.
# Working documents (audits, plans, session reports) live here but never reach
# the public repository. Publishing a NEW doc is a deliberate `git add -f`.
# Note: `git clean -x` deletes ignored files — keep a backup of private docs.
/docs/
